---
// 1.3 — Be transparent about AI: README provenance mockup
---

<div class="badge-wrap">
  <div class="badge-label">README.md — Provenance Section</div>
  <div class="readme-block">
    <div class="readme-heading">## AI Assistance Disclosure</div>
    <div class="readme-body">
      <p>This tool was written with the assistance of AI coding agents (Claude, GitHub Copilot).</p>
      <p>Correctness is validated by comparing output against <code>mytool v1.0</code> on a suite of real sequencing datasets — not by manual code review alone. The AI generated the implementation; humans defined the validation criteria and verified the results.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="readme-badge-row">
      <div class="readme-badge">
        <span class="rb-icon">🤖</span>
        <span class="rb-text">AI-assisted</span>
      </div>
      <div class="readme-badge rb-validated">
        <span class="rb-icon">✓</span>
        <span class="rb-text">Validated vs mytool v1.0</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="readme-note">
      <span class="note-key">Validation methodology:</span>
      <span class="note-link">github.com/user/mytool/VALIDATION.md</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .badge-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--section-color, var(--accent-rust));
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
  }

  .badge-label {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .readme-block {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.08);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .readme-heading {
    color: var(--accent-rust);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .readme-body {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .readme-body p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .readme-body code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    background: rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.06);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .readme-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .readme-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.1);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .rb-validated {
    background: rgba(93, 172, 114, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(93, 172, 114, 0.2);
    color: rgba(93, 172, 114, 0.9);
  }

  .rb-icon {
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .readme-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .note-key {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .note-link {
    color: var(--color-link);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
</style>
